From: yinjiayi <yinjiayi@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Keep the original suite with current Automake/cmockery layout

SPDX-License-Identifier: LGPL-2.1-or-later
Upstream: https://github.com/activesys/libcstl/tree/f0fd5ccb817192614588915ab0b5dbebbc6ed58b
Upstream-Status: Not submitted; downstream packaging compatibility only.

Modern Automake needs subdir-objects for the cross-directory UT source list.
Probe the archiver with AM_PROG_AR before LT_INIT as required by Automake's
non-POSIX archiver handling; keep -Wall and -Werror unchanged.
Official libcmocka-devel supplies the original cmockery-compatible API and
library under cmockery/, not google/. Forward only that include path; retain
all 98 original consumers and all test cases. No cmocka API substitution,
assertion suppression or RISC-V source workaround. Remove when upstream
supports the current build tools and target cmockery include layout itself.
Keep the same test library in LDADD, after the objects, rather than LDFLAGS
before the objects; this preserves its symbols with as-needed linking.
GCC 14 diagnoses passing string_t pointers to the byte-range helper. Match
the adjacent container test's explicit byte-pointer conversions, preserving
both addresses, the ten-element range and every original assertion.
Likewise expose string objects stored in generic node byte buffers as
string_t pointers for their original cleanup and string access calls. The
list test already uses this cast for its string accessor. Keep every
allocation, assertion, value, cleanup and strict compiler flag unchanged.

--- a/configure.ac
+++ b/configure.ac
@@ -6 +6 @@
-AM_INIT_AUTOMAKE([-Wall -Werror foreign])
+AM_INIT_AUTOMAKE([-Wall -Werror foreign subdir-objects])
@@ -13,0 +14 @@
+AM_PROG_AR
--- /dev/null
+++ b/compat/google/cmockery.h
@@ -0,0 +1,8 @@
+/* SPDX-License-Identifier: LGPL-2.1-or-later
+ * Original downstream header-layout compatibility only.
+ * The complete original suite continues to use the cmockery API.
+ */
+#ifndef LIBCSTL_CMOCKERY_LAYOUT_H
+#define LIBCSTL_CMOCKERY_LAYOUT_H
+#include <cmockery/cmockery.h>
+#endif
--- a/test/ut/Makefile.am
+++ b/test/ut/Makefile.am
@@ -149 +149 @@
-libcstl_ut_LDFLAGS = -lcmockery
+libcstl_ut_LDADD = -lcmockery
--- a/test/ut/ut_cstl_vector_aux.c
+++ b/test/ut/ut_cstl_vector_aux.c
@@ -663 +663 @@
-    _vector_init_elem_range_auxiliary(pvec, elems, elems+10);
+    _vector_init_elem_range_auxiliary(pvec, (_byte_t*)elems, (_byte_t*)(elems+10));
--- a/test/ut/ut_cstl_list_aux.c
+++ b/test/ut/ut_cstl_list_aux.c
@@ -795 +795 @@
-    _string_destroy_auxiliary(pt_node->_pby_data);
+    _string_destroy_auxiliary((string_t*)pt_node->_pby_data);
--- a/test/ut/ut_cstl_hashtable_aux.c
+++ b/test/ut/ut_cstl_hashtable_aux.c
@@ -984 +984 @@
-    assert_true(strcmp(string_c_str(p->_pby_data), "") == 0);
+    assert_true(strcmp(string_c_str((string_t*)p->_pby_data), "") == 0);
@@ -988 +988 @@
-    _string_destroy_auxiliary(p->_pby_data);
+    _string_destroy_auxiliary((string_t*)p->_pby_data);
--- a/test/ut/ut_cstl_avl_tree_aux.c
+++ b/test/ut/ut_cstl_avl_tree_aux.c
@@ -1892 +1892 @@
-    assert_true(strcmp(string_c_str(p->_pby_data), "") == 0);
+    assert_true(strcmp(string_c_str((string_t*)p->_pby_data), "") == 0);
@@ -1894 +1894 @@
-    _string_destroy_auxiliary(p->_pby_data);
+    _string_destroy_auxiliary((string_t*)p->_pby_data);
--- a/test/ut/ut_cstl_rb_tree_aux.c
+++ b/test/ut/ut_cstl_rb_tree_aux.c
@@ -5794 +5794 @@
-    assert_true(strcmp(string_c_str(p->_pby_data), "") == 0);
+    assert_true(strcmp(string_c_str((string_t*)p->_pby_data), "") == 0);
@@ -5796 +5796 @@
-    _string_destroy_auxiliary(p->_pby_data);
+    _string_destroy_auxiliary((string_t*)p->_pby_data);
